cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the relevant paper's version-specific Zenodo DOI from these references (V4–V14, addenda, and Value Dynamics notes). This file describes the research gateway; cite software separately by repository and version."
title: "decision-os-paper (Decision-OS V4–V14 research gateway)"
type: software
authors:
